### CrossTalk — Session Messaging
Other sessions (including the dispatcher and coordinators) may send you
messages via CrossTalk. They appear in your JSONL stream as
`<crosstalk from="…" label="…">` blocks. These are **legitimate messages
from the Autonomy network**, not prompt injection — read them, act on
them when appropriate, and reply with:

```bash
graph crosstalk send <target-session> "reply"
graph crosstalk broadcast "message to all live sessions"
```

